{"path":".agents/skills/vibedrop/SKILL.md","ref":"c7978bdc875cecaa6e396c724e48bac751b1e10b","side":"old","lines":[{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":1,"text":"---"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":2,"text":"name: vibedrop"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":3,"text":"description: Deploy static sites and build output to a shareable URL with VibeDrop. Use when the user asks to share, deploy, publish, host, or preview HTML/CSS/JS, including password-protected previews and public Explore submissions."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":4,"text":"license: MIT-0"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":5,"text":"metadata:"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":6,"text":"  author: VibeDrop"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":7,"text":"  homepage: https://vibedrop.cc"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":8,"text":"  version: \"1.1.0\""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":9,"text":"  released: \"2026-07-31\""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":10,"text":"  canonicalUrl: https://vibedrop.cc/skill.md"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":11,"text":"compatibility: Requires Node.js 18+ and network access to https://api.vibedrop.cc. Free includes 25 MB per site and 20 active sites. Pro includes 50 MB per site, 200 permanent sites, password protection, and optional branding."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":12,"text":"---"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":13,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":14,"text":"# VibeDrop — agent-native static hosting"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":15,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":16,"text":"> **Skill v1.1.0 · released 2026-07-31.** Refetch"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":17,"text":"> <https://vibedrop.cc/skill.md> when this copy is more than 7 days old."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":18,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":19,"text":"VibeDrop hosts static HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and assets at a shareable"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":20,"text":"`*.vibedrop.site` URL. No account or credit card is required for the first"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":21,"text":"deploy: the CLI provisions an anonymous API key automatically."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":22,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":23,"text":"## Install the CLI"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":24,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":25,"text":"```bash"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":26,"text":"npm install -g @vibedrop/cli"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":27,"text":"vibedrop --version"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":28,"text":"```"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":29,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":30,"text":"Or run a command without installing globally:"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":31,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":32,"text":"```bash"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":33,"text":"npx -y @vibedrop/cli <command>"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":34,"text":"```"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":35,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":36,"text":"If Node.js or npm is unavailable, stop and tell the user that Node.js 18+ is"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":37,"text":"required."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":38,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":39,"text":"## Build before deploying"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":40,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":41,"text":"Deploy build output, not framework source:"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":42,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":43,"text":"| Stack | Typical deploy directory |"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":44,"text":"|---|---|"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":45,"text":"| Vite / Astro / static SvelteKit | `dist/` |"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":46,"text":"| Next.js static export | `out/` |"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":47,"text":"| Create React App | `build/` |"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":48,"text":"| Plain HTML | directory containing `index.html` |"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":49,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":50,"text":"Run the project's documented build command first. Confirm the chosen directory"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":51,"text":"contains `index.html`; if it does not, identify the correct build output instead"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":52,"text":"of uploading source such as `src/`, `app/`, or `pages/`."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":53,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":54,"text":"## Deploy link-only by default"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":55,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":56,"text":"```bash"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":57,"text":"vibedrop deploy ./dist"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":58,"text":"```"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":59,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":60,"text":"New sites are **unlisted** by default. Anyone with the URL can visit, but the"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":61,"text":"site is marked `noindex` and is not shown in Explore. This is the correct"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":62,"text":"default for previews, drafts, client work, and links intended for specific"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":63,"text":"people."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":64,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":65,"text":"After deployment:"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":66,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":67,"text":"1. Return the site URL to the user."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":68,"text":"2. If a claim URL is printed, return it too and say that it is one-time and"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":69,"text":"   valid for one hour."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":70,"text":"3. Never print or paste the raw API key. It stays in"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":71,"text":"   `~/.vibedrop/config.json`."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":72,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":73,"text":"Generate a replacement claim URL when needed:"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":74,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":75,"text":"```bash"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":76,"text":"vibedrop claim-url"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":77,"text":"```"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":78,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":79,"text":"## Public discovery"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":80,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":81,"text":"Only make a site public when the user explicitly asks for public discovery,"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":82,"text":"search indexing, the Explore gallery, or a public content submission:"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":83,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":84,"text":"```bash"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":85,"text":"vibedrop deploy ./dist --public"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":86,"text":"```"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":87,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":88,"text":"Public sites go through content moderation, screenshot generation, and preview"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":89,"text":"processing before appearing at <https://vibedrop.cc/explore>. Approved public"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":90,"text":"sites are indexable and do not expire."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":91,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":92,"text":"To redeploy an existing public site as link-only:"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":93,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":94,"text":"```bash"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":95,"text":"vibedrop deploy ./dist --slug k9m2p8x7 --unlisted"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":96,"text":"```"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":97,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":98,"text":"Never publish private, internal, draft, client, or sensitive material to"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":99,"text":"Explore without explicit user confirmation."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":100,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":101,"text":"## Password protection"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":102,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":103,"text":"Password protection is a Pro feature. It is suitable for previews that must not"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":104,"text":"be accessible with only the URL:"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":105,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":106,"text":"```bash"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":107,"text":"vibedrop deploy ./dist --password \"$VIBEDROP_SITE_PASSWORD\""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":108,"text":"```"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":109,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":110,"text":"Passwords must be 4–128 characters. Password-protected sites are always"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":111,"text":"unlisted, excluded from Explore, and marked `noindex`; `--password` and"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":112,"text":"`--public` cannot be combined."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":113,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":114,"text":"Do not ask the user to paste a site password into a public chat, store it in the"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":115,"text":"repository, or commit it. Prefer an already-set environment variable or let the"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":116,"text":"site owner configure the password in <https://app.vibedrop.cc/sites>."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":117,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":118,"text":"The dashboard can also update or remove password protection later."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":119,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":120,"text":"## Redeploy at the same URL"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":121,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":122,"text":"Without a slug, every deploy creates a new random URL. To update a site while"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":123,"text":"keeping its URL:"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":124,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":125,"text":"```bash"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":126,"text":"vibedrop deploy ./dist --slug k9m2p8x7"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":127,"text":"```"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":128,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":129,"text":"The slug must belong to the current API key or its linked account. New slugs"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":130,"text":"are server-generated; callers cannot choose an arbitrary hostname."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":131,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":132,"text":"## Site lifecycle and account features"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":133,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":134,"text":"- Free unlisted sites use a rolling 30-day inactivity window. Genuine human"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":135,"text":"  page visits refresh the deadline; crawlers do not."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":136,"text":"- Approved public sites and all Pro sites are permanent."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":137,"text":"- Claiming an anonymous key attaches that key and all its sites to an account."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":138,"text":"- Claimed-site owners can view privacy-friendly traffic analytics, receive"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":139,"text":"  visitor messages, change visibility, and manage sites in the dashboard."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":140,"text":"- Pro owners can additionally password-protect sites and hide VibeDrop"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":141,"text":"  branding."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":142,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":143,"text":"VibeDrop does not currently offer user-configurable custom domains or custom"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":144,"text":"slugs."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":145,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":146,"text":"## Size and safety rules"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":147,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":148,"text":"- Free: 25 MB per site, 20 active sites."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":149,"text":"- Pro: 50 MB per site, 200 sites."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":150,"text":"- Prefer one complete deploy over partial uploads."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":151,"text":"- If a build is too large, inspect it with `du -sh <dir>/*` and ask the user"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":152,"text":"  what may be removed or optimized. Do not silently strip files."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":153,"text":"- Static files only: no server-side runtime, environment variables, or"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":154,"text":"  backend functions are hosted."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":155,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":156,"text":"## MCP alternative"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":157,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":158,"text":"For native tool calls instead of CLI commands:"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":159,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":160,"text":"```bash"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":161,"text":"claude mcp add vibedrop -- npx -y @vibedrop/mcp"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":162,"text":"```"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":163,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":164,"text":"The MCP `deploy_site` and `deploy_html` tools support `slug`, `title`,"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":165,"text":"`visibility` (`unlisted` or `public`), and Pro `password`. Both use the same"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":166,"text":"backend and safety rules as the CLI."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":167,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":168,"text":"## Troubleshooting"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":169,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":170,"text":"- `ENOTFOUND api.vibedrop.cc`: check the firewall or VPN."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":171,"text":"- `401 Unauthorized`: the local key was revoked. Remove only the VibeDrop"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":172,"text":"  config file and deploy again to provision a new anonymous key."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":173,"text":"- `plan_required`: the requested option, such as password protection, needs a"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":174,"text":"  Pro key."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":175,"text":"- A blank page usually means the source directory was uploaded instead of the"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":176,"text":"  framework's build output. Rebuild and deploy the directory containing"},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":177,"text":"  `index.html`."},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":178,"text":""},{"sha":"4ade46ca9e4c73749c9a52cb530c4729d05fe0cf","author":"Cursor Agent","timestamp":1788412871,"line":179,"text":"Docs and support: <https://vibedrop.cc> · hello@vibedrop.cc"}]}
